WEBVTT

00:00:16.727 --> 00:00:20.772
<i>Like countless dreams being granted,</i>

00:00:20.856 --> 00:00:24.735
<i>words without any sense of realness</i>

00:00:24.818 --> 00:00:28.780
<i>A future form that resides in them</i>

00:00:28.864 --> 00:00:38.248
<i>can be seen in your faintly gleaming eyes</i>

00:00:40.459 --> 00:00:48.425
<i>When we passed by like
it was coincidence back then</i>

00:00:48.508 --> 00:00:58.101
<i>our encounter began,
serving as some sort of delusion</i>

00:00:58.185 --> 00:01:02.606
<i>ls fate laughing? I can hear it</i>

00:01:02.689 --> 00:01:06.151
<i>intersecting joy and pain</i>

00:01:06.235 --> 00:01:10.572
<i>Grazed by the voice I heard that day</i>

00:01:10.656 --> 00:01:14.201
<i>I held onto a two-faced strength</i>

00:01:14.284 --> 00:01:22.125
<i>Now I'll unravel that unsolvable reason</i>

00:01:22.209 --> 00:01:32.719
<i>and fly beyond the wish I arranged</i>

00:02:25.731 --> 00:02:27.899
It's hot.

00:02:27.983 --> 00:02:29.067
Shana?

00:02:29.151 --> 00:02:30.193
What?

00:02:30.277 --> 00:02:33.488
Can't you cool the room with an
Unrestricted Method or something?

00:02:33.572 --> 00:02:35.574
I'm not an air conditioner.

00:02:35.657 --> 00:02:37.242
A Vv Vy' y Qu Qa nut?

00:02:37.325 --> 00:02:38.577
Man, it's hot...

00:02:38.660 --> 00:02:41.038
Unrestricted Methods aren't
as convenient as I thought...

00:02:42.080 --> 00:02:43.915
Shut up, shut up, shut up!

00:02:43.999 --> 00:02:47.044
I hate trivial little
Unrestricted Methods like that!

00:02:53.884 --> 00:02:57.554
Your pickiness has nothing
to do with this, though...

00:03:03.935 --> 00:03:09.691
"Reshuffle"

00:03:17.157 --> 00:03:18.200
C)oh!

00:03:18.283 --> 00:03:20.369
Nice and cool!

00:03:20.452 --> 00:03:24.956
Going through all this piece
by piece is going to take forever.

00:03:25.040 --> 00:03:27.375
Consider it a part of your training.

00:03:27.459 --> 00:03:29.002
Do not simply pick them up;

00:03:29.086 --> 00:03:32.756
imbue the area with
your power of existence as well.

00:03:32.839 --> 00:03:35.133
Some things might react to it.

00:03:35.217 --> 00:03:41.389
But... I don't know what to transfer
power into or how much to give it...

00:03:42.474 --> 00:03:46.228
Hope I don't find a Treasure that'll
go boom if I give it too much power...

00:03:46.311 --> 00:03:47.437
--Mm. It's possible.

00:03:47.437 --> 00:03:48.814
--Huh?!
--Mm. It's possible.

00:04:01.535 --> 00:04:03.495
What is this? A telescope?

00:04:06.832 --> 00:04:08.416
Hey, Shana.

00:04:21.346 --> 00:04:22.931
Wh-What was that?

00:04:28.395 --> 00:04:30.272
It can't be... It can't be...

00:04:30.355 --> 00:04:32.149
It can't be!

00:04:42.033 --> 00:04:43.493
Be quiet.

00:04:46.037 --> 00:04:47.414
Shana...?

00:04:56.756 --> 00:04:59.134
What did you do, Yuji Sakai?

00:04:59.217 --> 00:05:02.095
Oh? I-It's my fault after all?

00:05:02.179 --> 00:05:04.181
Just tell us what you did.

00:05:04.264 --> 00:05:06.057
What do you mean?

00:05:06.141 --> 00:05:10.228
I just picked up a black
telescope-looking tube

00:05:10.312 --> 00:05:12.647
and looked through it, that's all.

00:05:12.731 --> 00:05:13.690
<i>Master'?</i>

00:05:13.773 --> 00:05:18.236
Mm. A black, telescope-like tube...

00:05:18.320 --> 00:05:19.779
The Reshuffler!

00:05:20.780 --> 00:05:23.783
As you can see,
it is a Treasure that switches

00:05:23.867 --> 00:05:27.662
the minds of the looker and the lookee.

00:05:27.746 --> 00:05:30.332
Shana and I... have switched?

00:05:32.584 --> 00:05:34.878
But you need not worry.

00:05:34.961 --> 00:05:37.506
Looking through it again
should return you to normal.

00:05:37.589 --> 00:05:40.008
Oh, in that case...!

00:05:40.091 --> 00:05:41.885
Hold on!

00:05:45.263 --> 00:05:47.224
Watch where you're touching!

00:05:47.766 --> 00:05:48.850
S-Stupid Yuji.

00:05:48.934 --> 00:05:51.478
Y-You're the one who...

00:05:58.944 --> 00:06:01.363
Wh-Wh-What were you looking at?!

00:06:01.446 --> 00:06:03.406
I didn't look at anything!

00:06:05.867 --> 00:06:07.535
Stop... Shana...!

00:06:07.619 --> 00:06:09.871
This is what you get for
misbehaving with my body!

00:06:09.955 --> 00:06:11.206
--You're the one who sent me flying!

00:06:11.206 --> 00:06:14.584
--Shut up, shut up, shut up!
--You're the one who sent me flying!

00:06:14.668 --> 00:06:18.630
We can turn back if we
look through it again, right?

00:06:18.713 --> 00:06:20.757
If we search the area I was just at...

00:06:20.840 --> 00:06:22.884
Oh no! You must hurry!

00:06:22.968 --> 00:06:27.931
Others must not learn of your situation,
especially the Flame Hazes!

00:06:28.014 --> 00:06:30.976
Wh-Why, is this bad?

00:06:31.059 --> 00:06:32.936
What do you mean, Alastor?

00:06:33.019 --> 00:06:33.561
--Just hurry!

00:06:33.561 --> 00:06:36.022
--Hey! We brought ice cream!
--Just hurry!

00:06:36.106 --> 00:06:38.441
Man, it's dark in here.

00:06:38.525 --> 00:06:40.986
We brought a bunch just
like Shana-chan asked, too.

00:06:41.069 --> 00:06:42.445
Did she leave or something?

00:06:42.529 --> 00:06:43.488
Hey!

00:06:43.572 --> 00:06:45.407
Wh-What do we do, Shana?!

00:06:45.490 --> 00:06:47.450
Don't act weak like that!

00:06:47.534 --> 00:06:48.952
But...

00:06:49.035 --> 00:06:50.245
--Get the Night Cape.

00:06:50.245 --> 00:06:51.329
--Huh?
--Get the Night Cape.

00:06:51.413 --> 00:06:54.040
Put everything near
where you were sitting inside it

00:06:54.124 --> 00:06:55.584
so we can look through it elsewhere.

00:06:55.667 --> 00:06:57.502
All right, Alastor?

00:06:57.586 --> 00:06:58.545
Mm...

00:06:59.170 --> 00:07:00.547
Mm.

00:07:02.465 --> 00:07:06.886
Heighten your feelings in an explosive
manner and release the power you want.

00:07:06.970 --> 00:07:10.098
Visualize the look and strength of
a flame-haired, burning-eyed slayer

00:07:10.181 --> 00:07:12.892
and use the power that wells
up inside you to manifest it.

00:07:12.976 --> 00:07:15.020
C'mon, where are you?

00:07:15.103 --> 00:07:17.063
The ice cream's gonna melt.

00:07:23.486 --> 00:07:26.197
H-How much should I take in?

00:07:26.281 --> 00:07:28.491
That's enough. They're coming.

00:07:32.912 --> 00:07:34.289
Oh, here they are.

00:07:34.372 --> 00:07:35.832
What are you guys doing?!

00:07:35.915 --> 00:07:39.044
Geez, you could've
at least responded, Sakai!

00:07:39.127 --> 00:07:41.338
S-Sorry! I couldn't hear you!

00:07:41.421 --> 00:07:44.549
Oh, no, I was talking to Sakai...

00:07:44.633 --> 00:07:48.136
Oh, that's what Yuji said. R-Right, Yuji?

00:07:48.219 --> 00:07:50.388
Y-Yeah. I said that.

00:07:50.472 --> 00:07:52.515
Is something wrong with you guys?

00:07:52.599 --> 00:07:54.434
No, nothing at all!

00:07:55.477 --> 00:07:57.103
I'm Yuji Sakai!

00:07:57.187 --> 00:07:59.189
Really, nothing's wrong!

00:07:59.272 --> 00:08:02.025
Shut up, shut up, shut up!

00:08:02.108 --> 00:08:03.985
Quit talking that way. It's wretched.

00:08:04.069 --> 00:08:06.571
You're the one who laughed like a weirdo.

00:08:06.654 --> 00:08:08.448
You always laugh like this, Yuji!

00:08:08.531 --> 00:08:10.742
Is that how you see me?!

00:08:10.825 --> 00:08:13.161
Hey. What the heck's going on?

00:08:16.956 --> 00:08:19.292
Umm, Alastor-san...?

00:08:19.376 --> 00:08:21.419
Oh, I just remembered some urgent business.

00:08:21.503 --> 00:08:22.962
Let's leave, you two.

00:08:23.046 --> 00:08:25.465
Yes, we should go quickly!

00:08:25.548 --> 00:08:27.425
<i>Sate'. Tanaka'. See ya'.!</i>

00:08:27.509 --> 00:08:28.468
Good bye!

00:08:28.551 --> 00:08:29.552
--"See..."

00:08:29.552 --> 00:08:30.929
--"See ya"?
--"See..."

00:08:32.764 --> 00:08:35.600
S-Stop acting like that! ...Man!

00:08:35.683 --> 00:08:38.812
It ain't my-- I can't help it!
I'm not used to this!

00:08:38.895 --> 00:08:40.772
Shut up! Shut up! Shut up!

00:08:40.855 --> 00:08:41.898
--Be careful, will you?!

00:08:41.898 --> 00:08:43.733
--What's keeping Margery-san?
--Be careful, will you?!

00:08:43.817 --> 00:08:46.486
They took all the ice cream...

00:08:53.993 --> 00:08:57.038
In any case, we need to change back quickly.

00:08:57.997 --> 00:09:01.709
We need a place where we
can rummage through the items...

00:09:01.793 --> 00:09:02.961
--Why not use a Seal?

00:09:02.961 --> 00:09:04.003
--No.
--Why not use a Seal?

00:09:04.087 --> 00:09:08.341
The power of existence will attract
Wilhelmina and Chanter of Elegies.

00:09:11.010 --> 00:09:14.305
A somewhat spacious room where
no one will bother us...

00:09:15.223 --> 00:09:17.392
How about a karaoke room?

00:09:17.392 --> 00:09:21.396
"Karaoke Village"

00:09:21.396 --> 00:09:22.021
We can get a big private room
where no one will bother us.

00:09:22.105 --> 00:09:24.190
Best of all, it has air conditioning!

00:09:24.899 --> 00:09:26.192
Oh!

00:09:26.276 --> 00:09:28.236
If it isn't the little brat and the boy.

00:09:28.319 --> 00:09:29.696
Chanter of Elegies...!

00:09:29.779 --> 00:09:31.698
What are you doing in a place like this?

00:09:31.781 --> 00:09:33.742
U-Umm, err...

00:09:33.825 --> 00:09:39.205
Oh, uhh... I-It's none of your business,
Chanter of Elegies...

00:09:40.206 --> 00:09:43.835
You're as uncute as ever, I see.

00:09:43.918 --> 00:09:46.421
Doubt she wants to
get called cute by a drunk

00:09:46.504 --> 00:09:49.966
who gets wasted here in
the middle of the day, though!

00:09:50.049 --> 00:09:51.759
Shut up, stupid Marco!

00:09:51.843 --> 00:09:55.472
Anyway, your underlings should
be waiting for you at the Hunter's lair.

00:09:55.555 --> 00:09:58.016
Yeah, no problem! I know!

00:09:58.099 --> 00:10:00.310
I'll head on over once I finish this!

00:10:00.393 --> 00:10:03.146
Hey, now! Where are you guys gain'?

00:10:03.229 --> 00:10:05.064
The treasure hunt can't be over yet!

00:10:05.148 --> 00:10:07.358
Something's come up. Bye.

00:10:10.570 --> 00:10:13.072
What's with them?

00:10:13.156 --> 00:10:13.948
--I'll have another please!

00:10:13.948 --> 00:10:15.366
--Huh?
--I'll have another please!

00:10:15.450 --> 00:10:16.826
Hey!

00:10:21.664 --> 00:10:25.001
Of all the times people have
to get in the way...

00:10:25.084 --> 00:10:27.128
Sheesh. Why'd this have to happen?

00:10:27.212 --> 00:10:28.505
Sorry...

00:10:28.588 --> 00:10:30.798
Stop looking so miserable.

00:10:38.556 --> 00:10:40.975
Mm! That ice cream was good!

00:10:41.059 --> 00:10:42.185
Man, you're carefree.

00:10:42.268 --> 00:10:45.063
You ate it already?
There was so much of it, too...

00:10:45.146 --> 00:10:47.732
Just figure out a place we can go.

00:10:47.815 --> 00:10:50.652
A somewhat spacious place where
we won't be disturbed

00:10:50.735 --> 00:10:52.654
and with no people around...

00:10:52.737 --> 00:10:55.698
A place that's deserted on Sundays...

00:11:01.412 --> 00:11:03.790
That's it! That's just the place!

00:11:09.671 --> 00:11:11.381
The school was a good idea.

00:11:11.464 --> 00:11:13.633
Yeah, no one comes here on Sundays.

00:11:18.179 --> 00:11:20.515
Oh, Shana-chan! Sakai-kun!

00:11:20.598 --> 00:11:22.767
I-Ike? Yoshida-san...?!

00:11:22.851 --> 00:11:25.728
Hello, Sakai-kun.
You too, Shana-chan.

00:11:25.812 --> 00:11:27.730
Whew, what a relief!

00:11:27.814 --> 00:11:30.066
I thought I was the only guy here!

00:11:30.149 --> 00:11:33.403
It's a home game, yet almost no one
else from our class has showed up,

00:11:33.486 --> 00:11:35.864
so we were just wondering what to do.

00:11:35.947 --> 00:11:39.200
Umm, remind me, what's going on today?

00:11:40.326 --> 00:11:42.787
Oga-chan's volleyball match.

00:11:42.870 --> 00:11:44.914
She asked us to come
cheer her on, remember?

00:11:44.998 --> 00:11:46.332
Oh...

00:11:46.416 --> 00:11:50.503
Let's really cheer her on, Sakai-kun!

00:11:50.587 --> 00:11:52.380
L-I guess...

00:11:52.880 --> 00:11:54.173
This is great!

00:11:54.257 --> 00:11:57.802
Everyone's going to be so excited
when they hear you came, Shana-chan!

00:11:57.886 --> 00:12:00.346
--C'mon! Let's hurry to the gym!
--U-Umm, uhh...

00:12:00.430 --> 00:12:02.515
Sorry. We'll be there later.

00:12:11.774 --> 00:12:16.321
Hey, you don't think they're
going to the classroom, do you?

00:12:20.491 --> 00:12:22.452
Run faster, Yuji!

00:12:23.494 --> 00:12:25.455
L-I know...!

00:12:30.084 --> 00:12:34.964
So Shana always runs so
fast with such a small stride...?

00:12:38.593 --> 00:12:40.553
S-Sakai-kun!

00:12:41.888 --> 00:12:43.681
What's going on?!

00:12:44.140 --> 00:12:45.308
No looking, Yuji!

00:12:45.391 --> 00:12:48.853
Hold on, Sakai-kun!
Why are you covering her eyes?!

00:12:50.855 --> 00:12:52.732
Sorry! Sorry!

00:12:56.778 --> 00:12:58.696
Well, that was a disaster...

00:12:58.780 --> 00:13:00.907
"The school will be empty," my eye.

00:13:00.990 --> 00:13:02.909
We ran into acquaintances
everywhere we went.

00:13:02.992 --> 00:13:06.079
You agreed with the idea right away, Shana.

00:13:06.162 --> 00:13:09.582
I guess your room is our best option.

00:13:09.666 --> 00:13:10.500
--Let's hurry.

00:13:10.500 --> 00:13:11.876
--Yeah.
--Let's hurry.

00:13:21.302 --> 00:13:22.512
Man...

00:13:22.595 --> 00:13:28.601
Skirts are nice and cool and all,
but panties are so unpleasantly tight...

00:13:28.685 --> 00:13:30.103
Hey, Shana.

00:13:30.186 --> 00:13:32.105
We've run into so many people we know

00:13:32.188 --> 00:13:34.607
that we won't run into anymore now... right?

00:13:34.691 --> 00:13:35.942
I don't know.

00:13:36.025 --> 00:13:39.237
Wilhelmina said she was going
to start investigating the city, but...

00:13:39.320 --> 00:13:43.866
Should we encounter her,
she must not learn of this situation.

00:13:43.950 --> 00:13:45.535
No matter what.

00:13:46.244 --> 00:13:50.665
Does the Reshuffler have a secret
that's that important to hide?

00:13:54.544 --> 00:13:56.504
What is it, Yu--?

00:13:58.881 --> 00:14:00.258
Grr.

00:14:16.065 --> 00:14:20.611
Were you not going to search for
Treasures today at the Hunter's hideout?

00:14:20.695 --> 00:14:21.988
Early departure suspicious.

00:14:22.071 --> 00:14:23.448
W-Well...

00:14:23.531 --> 00:14:26.617
lam not asking you, indeed.

00:14:26.701 --> 00:14:30.830
Oh, I promise you, we aren't slacking off...

00:14:30.913 --> 00:14:32.081
Watch how you talk, idiot!

00:14:32.165 --> 00:14:33.207
Idiot?

00:14:33.291 --> 00:14:34.751
Improper manners.

00:14:34.834 --> 00:14:37.920
Oh, we have pressing matters to attend to!

00:14:38.004 --> 00:14:39.422
Let us go, you two!

00:14:39.505 --> 00:14:41.299
R-Right! Okay!

00:14:41.382 --> 00:14:43.926
See you later, Wilhelmina!

00:14:51.225 --> 00:14:53.978
Oh no! I was so flustered
that my reflexes took over...!

00:14:59.233 --> 00:14:59.817
--Gas explosions?!

00:14:59.817 --> 00:15:01.778
--Is someone popping balloons?
--Gas explosions?!

00:15:01.861 --> 00:15:03.613
That's not a gun, I hope!

00:15:03.696 --> 00:15:06.991
A double strike... It had enough
strength to send me flying, too.

00:15:09.202 --> 00:15:11.120
We don't have the time for this.

00:15:11.204 --> 00:15:14.499
Why does Wilhelmina have to
be so obstinate and competitive?!

00:15:14.582 --> 00:15:16.250
Improved defenses.

00:15:16.334 --> 00:15:18.920
No, this is on a different level
altogether, indeed.

00:15:19.003 --> 00:15:20.963
Another possibility is that...

00:15:22.340 --> 00:15:25.301
Are you really the Mystes, indeed?

00:15:27.178 --> 00:15:30.473
Wh-What are you talking about?

00:15:39.106 --> 00:15:41.484
I love you, Wilhelmina!

00:15:44.362 --> 00:15:46.030
Wh-Wha...?

00:15:48.032 --> 00:15:50.368
Run for it!

00:15:50.451 --> 00:15:52.620
Wh-Why did you say that, Yuji?!

00:15:52.703 --> 00:15:55.540
It's not like it was a lie!
Besides, it worked!

00:15:55.623 --> 00:15:58.960
Well... That's true... It's not a lie, but...

00:16:01.420 --> 00:16:03.965
Bold... declaration...

00:16:05.550 --> 00:16:08.386
"Sakai"

00:16:08.386 --> 00:16:09.095
F-Finally home...

00:16:09.178 --> 00:16:11.097
No dawdling! Hurry to your room!

00:16:11.180 --> 00:16:14.517
Th-That's easy for you to say...

00:16:14.600 --> 00:16:16.727
I-I get tired fast in this body...

00:16:16.811 --> 00:16:18.563
You get exhausted easily

00:16:18.646 --> 00:16:21.440
because you still can't use
the power of existence properly.

00:16:21.524 --> 00:16:22.567
I'm home.

00:16:22.650 --> 00:16:23.776
What's the deal?

00:16:23.860 --> 00:16:26.404
There's no rush now that we're here...

00:16:35.913 --> 00:16:37.874
What are you doing?! Hurry up!

00:16:37.957 --> 00:16:39.750
O-Okay...

00:16:42.378 --> 00:16:44.755
She definitely wobbled just now.

00:16:44.839 --> 00:16:48.092
Does that Treasure
have some sort of side effect?

00:16:48.175 --> 00:16:50.261
If so...

00:16:50.344 --> 00:16:52.305
Oh, welcome back!

00:16:52.388 --> 00:16:54.473
Weren't you supposed to come home late?

00:16:54.557 --> 00:16:56.517
Things ended prematurely.

00:16:58.477 --> 00:17:00.813
Oh, Shana-chan. You're dripping with sweat.

00:17:00.897 --> 00:17:02.565
Go on and take a bath!

00:17:02.648 --> 00:17:05.610
Oh, no, I don't have the time for--

00:17:09.822 --> 00:17:13.951
Umm, I don't think I can today...

00:17:14.035 --> 00:17:15.411
Hurry!

00:17:21.959 --> 00:17:24.337
Shana! Why do you look so pale?!

00:17:24.420 --> 00:17:27.798
Does it take a toll on our bodies
if we don't revert right away?!

00:17:27.882 --> 00:17:30.468
Why didn't you say
something sooner, Alastor?!

00:17:30.551 --> 00:17:32.011
Err, well...

00:17:33.721 --> 00:17:37.391
<i>So the Reshuifler has side effects
not even Master knows about.</i>

00:17:37.475 --> 00:17:39.644
If a Flame Haze uses it instead of a Denizen

00:17:39.727 --> 00:17:42.772
it causes damage, and, in the worst case...

00:17:42.855 --> 00:17:43.856
<i>Master!</i>

00:17:43.940 --> 00:17:47.443
We'll go back to normal
if we use that Treasure again, right?!

00:17:47.526 --> 00:17:49.570
M-Mm.

00:17:49.654 --> 00:17:52.615
Hang in there, Shana! I'll look for it now!

00:17:53.991 --> 00:17:55.368
Come out!

00:17:56.118 --> 00:17:57.495
You fool!

00:18:17.098 --> 00:18:22.353
Right now, I'm in control of Yuji's body...

00:18:50.548 --> 00:18:53.259
Yu-chan! Shana-chan!

00:18:53.342 --> 00:18:55.011
What was that sound just now?

00:18:55.094 --> 00:18:56.303
I'm so stupid!

00:18:56.387 --> 00:18:58.389
There's no meaning if we don't do it together!

00:18:58.472 --> 00:19:00.182
He)', What's going on?

00:19:00.266 --> 00:19:04.645
Seal!

00:19:04.729 --> 00:19:08.065
Yuji. Yuji, wake up!

00:19:08.149 --> 00:19:10.985
What's going on...?

00:19:11.068 --> 00:19:13.279
Shana! Are you all right?!

00:19:13.362 --> 00:19:16.240
Mm. It's not as bad now.

00:19:16.324 --> 00:19:17.366
Huh?

00:19:17.450 --> 00:19:20.619
Anyway, hurry and put this away.
There's no room to move.

00:19:20.703 --> 00:19:22.580
O-Oh. Right.

00:19:44.060 --> 00:19:45.853
Is this it?

00:19:46.312 --> 00:19:47.605
Well done, Shana!

00:19:47.688 --> 00:19:49.273
We have to turn back right away!

00:19:49.356 --> 00:19:51.692
Mm. Prepare yourself.

00:19:51.776 --> 00:19:53.152
Huh?

00:20:06.207 --> 00:20:07.208
Are you back?

00:20:07.291 --> 00:20:09.585
Yeah, I'm back.

00:20:13.089 --> 00:20:15.674
Hey, Shana! What is this...?!

00:20:15.758 --> 00:20:17.593
I'd hurry if I were you.

00:20:17.676 --> 00:20:20.638
You could've mentioned that sooner!

00:20:22.306 --> 00:20:23.682
Move, Mom!

00:20:29.897 --> 00:20:32.817
Was it all that ice cream?

00:20:32.900 --> 00:20:36.028
Mm. Yuji's body really is weak.

00:20:36.112 --> 00:20:39.240
His stomach can't even handle
a couple dozen ice pops.

00:20:39.323 --> 00:20:42.576
Honestly, now! Don't worry me like that!

00:20:42.660 --> 00:20:44.036
Sorry.

00:20:45.037 --> 00:20:47.164
You can tell me now, right?

00:20:47.248 --> 00:20:49.542
Why was it dangerous for anyone to learn

00:20:49.625 --> 00:20:51.919
that this had switched our bodies?

00:20:52.002 --> 00:20:56.715
I don't really want to use it,
but it could be a useful weapon sometime.

00:20:56.799 --> 00:20:59.677
But if the Hunter didn't use it,

00:20:59.760 --> 00:21:02.388
there must be more to
it we don't know about, huh?

00:21:02.471 --> 00:21:05.099
If I tell you,
you must promise to destroy it.

00:21:05.182 --> 00:21:06.100
Mm.

00:21:06.183 --> 00:21:07.726
I will say this only once.

00:21:07.810 --> 00:21:13.107
This item only works when
both minds are free of barriers.

00:21:13.190 --> 00:21:17.903
We cannot afford to let others
know that you two are that intimate.

00:21:17.987 --> 00:21:21.365
Naturally, I don't wish to speak of it, either.

00:21:22.950 --> 00:21:26.954
We especially cannot tell this
to Wilhelmina Carmel.

00:21:27.037 --> 00:21:32.835
Nor to her friend,
Chanter of Elegies, or her subordinates.

00:21:32.918 --> 00:21:35.671
Oh, but... it's not like that.

00:21:35.754 --> 00:21:37.631
Save the excuses.

00:21:37.715 --> 00:21:41.177
It has tangibly manifested itself;
it is an undeniable fact.

00:21:41.260 --> 00:21:44.346
...As reluctant as I am to admit it.

00:21:44.430 --> 00:21:47.349
No! It's not like that, Alastor...!

00:21:47.433 --> 00:21:50.436
You've left the Seal up.

00:21:50.519 --> 00:21:53.522
Save your excuses for the Missus.

00:21:55.191 --> 00:21:57.610
<i>Oh. "W-</i>

00:21:57.693 --> 00:21:58.819
What happened here?

00:21:58.903 --> 00:22:00.863
Just a little argument.

00:22:00.946 --> 00:22:04.158
What could've caused an argument like this?

00:22:04.241 --> 00:22:08.204
Did Yu-chan do something bad?
Or did you, maybe?

00:22:10.331 --> 00:22:11.790
Yuji.

00:22:11.874 --> 00:22:14.251
It was all Yuji's fault.

00:22:20.090 --> 00:22:26.096
<i>We held on to feelings
we couldn't give up</i>

00:22:26.180 --> 00:22:32.186
<i>Even so, we've walked this far</i>

00:22:32.269 --> 00:22:39.735
<i>It's like we haven't made any progress,
and have only slightly touched</i>

00:22:39.818 --> 00:22:45.658
a <i>wish carried</i> by <i>the waves of time</i>

00:22:45.741 --> 00:22:51.914
<i>Visiting distant memories</i>

00:22:51.997 --> 00:23:02.299
<i>I feel like things shine with,
"This wasn't how it was"</i>

00:23:02.383 --> 00:23:09.932
<i>After getting through that bright day</i>

00:23:10.015 --> 00:23:12.226
<i>we're here now</i>

00:23:12.309 --> 00:23:22.236
<i>In this place where endings
and beginnings don't exist</i>

00:23:22.319 --> 00:23:24.613
<i>I am sure we will now</i>

00:23:24.697 --> 00:23:36.583
<i>walk again and discover a new dream</i>
